      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10763109475374222
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Learned Standing Counsel submitted that since parties have settled their disputes in Mediation Cell,\nKarkardooma Courts, they be called in person.",
